    "updated_at": "2016-11-16T23:45:55Z",
    "body": "So it sounds like you are probably in favor of exposing this on a spec level only, with no `stream.clone()`, but just some behind the scenes magic to make `request.clone()` work? That sounds OK-ish to me.\n\nI'd love to hear some more opinions. @jakearchibald, @wanderview, @annevk, @tyoshino, @ricea, any thoughts?\n",
